Echo-Bench — Data License
=========================

Scope
-----
This license covers the data produced by the Echo-Bench study and released in
this repository:

  * data/scores_final_v1.jsonl        (4,032 turn-level ratings)
  * data/gold_set.json                (28-item human gold set)
  * data/gold_set_diagnostics.md      (join diagnostics for the gold set)
  * data/arbitration_final_24.json    (24 human adjudication finals)
  * data/spotcheck_27.json            (27-item blind human spot check)
  * data/spotcheck_audit.json         (sampling frame and coverage of the spot check)
  * data/needs_human_review_136.jsonl (136 extreme-score escalation records)
  * docs/评分标准.md                    (human scoring rubric)
  * the release documentation: README.md, data/README.md, code/README.md,
